{"data":[{"id":"66512","title":"Islam is built on five","translations":["ar","es","am","en","ur","id","ug","bn","fr","tr","ru","bs","si","hi","zh","fa","vi","tl","ku","ha","pt","ml","te","sw","ta","my","th","de","ja","ps","as","sq","sv","nl","gu","ky","ne","yo","lt","prs","sr","so","tg","rw","ro","hu","cs","mos","mg","ff","om","kn","wo","az","uz","uk","ka","mk","km","bm","pa","mr","rn","kmr","ms","yao","ak","ln","da"]},{"id":"66525","title":"If I were to pray the obligatory prayers, fast Ramadan, adopt the lawful, as lawful and adopt the unlawful as unlawful","translations":["ar","es","am","en","ur","id","bn","fr","tr","ru","bs","si","hi","zh","fa","vi","tl","ku","ha","pt","ml","te","sw","ta","my","th","de","ps","as","sq","nl","gu","ky","ne","lt","prs","sr","tg","rw","ro","hu","cs","mos","mg","om","kn","wo","az","uz","uk","ka","mk","km","bm","pa","mr","rn","kmr","ms","da"]},{"id":"66530","title":"You have asked about something grave, but it is easy for whomever Allah makes it easy for","translations":["ar","es","am","en","ur","id","bn","fr","tr","ru","bs","si","hi","zh","fa","vi","tl","ku","ha","pt","ml","te","sw","ta","th","de","ps","as","sq","nl","gu","ky","ne","lt","prs","sr","tg","rw","ro","hu","cs","mos","mg","om","kn","wo","az","uz","uk","ka","mk","km","pa","mr","rn","kmr","ms","my","bm","da"]},{"id":"3390","title":"You will come to a people of the Scripture. When you reach them, invite them to testify that none is worthy of worship except Allah and that Muhammad is the Messenger of Allah","translations":["ar","bn","bs","en","es","fa","fr","id","ru","tl","tr","ur","zh","hi","ug","ku","ha","pt","ml","te","sw","my","de","ja","ps","vi","as","sq","sv","cs","gu","yo","nl","si","ta","prs","ak","bg","ff","hu","kn","ky","lt","ne","or","ro","rw","tg","uz","az","mos","wo","om","so","uk","bm","km","rn","ka","mk","sr","el","am","mg","th","da","mr","pa","ln","it","kmr","ms"]},{"id":"65000","title":"Islam is built on five","translations":["ar","ku","en","sw","es","ur","pt","bn","id","fa","ta","hi","si","vi","ml","ru","my","th","ps","as","sq","sv","cs","gu","am","yo","ug","ha","prs","ky","or","ne","rw","ro","te","bs","lt","nl","so","sr","de","uk","kn","wo","mos","ka","az","zh","hu","tl","mk","mg","om","mr","pa","tr","uz","km","ms","tg","rn","bm","kmr","ff","fr","ja","da"]},{"id":"65002","title":"He who does good in Islam will not be punished for what he did during j\u0101hiliyyah, and he who commits evil in Islam will be punished for the previous and later deeds","translations":["ar","ku","en","sw","es","ur","pt","bn","id","fa","ta","hi","si","vi","ml","ru","my","th","ps","as","sq","sv","cs","gu","yo","nl","ug","bs","ha","te","prs","el","az","bg","ff","kn","ky","lt","or","ro","rw","sr","tg","uz","ne","mos","wo","tl","so","fr","uk","bm","de","ka","mk","hu","zh","rn","km","am","mg","om","da","mr","pa","tr","ln","it","yao","kmr","ja","ms"]},{"id":"3700","title":"He will succeed if he proves to be truthful","translations":["ar","bs","en","es","fa","fr","id","ru","tr","ur","zh","hi","ku","sw","pt","si","prs","as","vi","sv","yo","ky","gu","ha","ne","ro","ml","nl","so","te","ps","rw","kn","sr","mos","ka","cs","hu","uk","mk","lt","az","wo","mg","bn","om","th","de","mr","pa","am","km","tl","sq","ta","my","uz","kmr","tg"]},{"id":"4211","title":"I have been commanded to fight people until they testify that there is no god but Allah and that Muhammad is the Messenger of Allah, establish prayer, and pay Zakah","translations":["ar","bn","bs","en","es","fa","fr","id","ru","tl","tr","ur","zh","hi","ha","ku","sw","pt","si","sv","gu","yo","ug","vi","ps","as","prs","ky","or","ne","cs","ro","nl","so","te","ml","sr","rw","kn","lt","sq","wo","uk","ka","mos","hu","mk","az","mg","om","th","de","mr","pa","am","uz","km","ta","ms","tg","rn","kmr","bm","my","ja","da"]},{"id":"4303","title":"You have asked me about a great matter, which is, indeed, easy for whomever Allah makes it easy","translations":["ar","bs","en","es","fa","fr","id","ru","tr","ur","zh","hi","ha","ku","pt","si","nl","as","vi","sw","gu","ps","ro","ml","ne","de","ky","te","ka","mos","hu","sv","mk","kn","uk","am","rw","om","th","lt","sr","tl","mr","pa","prs","bn","mg","km","uz","ta","az","wo","cs","tg","ms","sq","kmr","rn","ja","bm","da"]},{"id":"4815","title":"Do not kill him, for if you kill him, he will be in the same position as yours before you kill him, and you will be in the same position as his before saying the word that he said","translations":["ar","bn","bs","en","es","id","ru","tl","tr","ur","zh","hi","ku","pt","si","nl","as","vi","sw","gu","ps","ha","ro","ml","ne","de","ky","ka","mos","hu","te","sv","fa","mk","kn","uk","rw","om","th","sr","mr","wo","pa","prs","am","mg","km","lt","ta","sq","my","tg"]},{"id":"4816","title":"O Us\u0101mah, you killed him after he had said \"there is no god but Allah\"?","translations":["ar","bn","bs","en","es","fr","id","ru","tr","ur","zh","hi","ug","ha","ku","pt","si"]},{"id":"4969","title":"The believers, in their mutual love, compassion, and sympathy, are like a single body; if one of its organs suffers, the whole body will respond with sleeplessness and fever","translations":["ar","bn","bs","en","es","fa","id","ru","tl","ur","zh","hi","ha","ku","pt","si","sv","gu","yo","ug","vi","sw","ps","as","prs","ky","or","ne","cs","ro","nl","so","te","ml","sr","rw","kn","lt","wo","uk","ka","mos","hu","sq","mk","az","am","mg","om","de","th","mr","pa","tr","uz","it","km","my","kmr","tg"]},{"id":"65009","title":"for he did not ever say: My Lord, forgive my sins on the Day of Judgment","translations":["ar","en","my","sv","cs","gu","yo","nl","ur","es","id","ug","bn","bs","si","hi","vi","ku","ha","ml","te","sw","ps","as","sq","prs","el","bg","ff","kn","ky","lt","or","ro","rw","sr","tg","uz","ne","mos","wo","so","tl","fr","az","uk","bm","ta","de","ka","pt","mk","hu","fa","ru","zh","km","mg","om","th","da","mr","pa","tr","ln","it","am","rn","kmr","ja","ms","yao"]},{"id":"65013","title":"Satan comes to one of you and says, 'Who created such and such, and who created such and such', until he says: 'Who created your Lord?' If a person experiences this, he should seek refuge with Allah and desist from that","translations":["ar","en","my","sv","cs","gu","yo","nl","ur","es","id","ug","bn","bs","si","hi","vi","ha","ml","te","sw","ps","as","sq","prs","el","bg","ff","kn","ky","lt","or","ro","rw","sr","tg","uz","ne","mos","ku","wo","so","fr","tl","az","uk","bm","ta","de","ka","pt","mk","hu","fa","ru","zh","km","am","mg","om","th","da","mr","pa","tr","ln","it","rn","kmr","ja","ms"]},{"id":"65015","title":"Allah does not wrong a believer in a good deed; he will be given on account of it in this world and will be rewarded for it in the Hereafter","translations":["ar","en","my","sv","cs","gu","yo","nl","ur","es","id","ug","bn","bs","si","hi","vi","ha","ml","te","sw","ps","as","sq","prs","el","bg","ff","kn","ky","lt","or","ro","rw","sr","tg","uz","ne","mos","ku","wo","so","fr","tl","az","uk","bm","ta","de","ka","pt","mk","hu","fa","ru","zh","km","am","mg","om","th","mr","pa","tr","ln","it","da","rn","kmr","ja","ms"]},{"id":"65016","title":"You have embraced Islam along with your past good deeds","translations":["ar","en","my","sv","cs","gu","yo","nl","ur","es","id","ug","bn","bs","si","hi","vi","ha","ml","te","sw","ps","as","sq","prs","el","bg","ff","kn","ky","lt","or","ro","rw","sr","tg","uz","ne","mos","ku","wo","so","fr","tl","az","uk","bm","ta","de","ka","pt","mk","hu","fa","ru","zh","km","am","mg","om","th","mr","pa","tr","ln","it","da","rn","kmr","ja","ms"]},{"id":"65037","title":"The Messenger of Allah (may Allah\u2019s peace and blessings be upon him) related to us, and he is the truthful and the trusted one; he said: \"The creation of each one of you is brought together in his mother's womb for forty days and forty nights","translations":["ar","en","my","sv","cs","gu","yo","nl","ur","es","id","ug","bn","bs","si","hi","vi","ha","ml","te","sw","ps","as","sq","prs","el","bg","ff","kn","ky","lt","ro","rw","sr","tg","uz","ne","mos","ku","wo","so","fr","az","tl","uk","ta","bm","de","ka","pt","mk","hu","fa","ru","zh","km","am","mg","om","th","mr","pa","tr","ln","it","ms","da","rn","kmr","ja"]},{"id":"65044","title":"I am Dim\u0101m ibn Tha\u2018labah, from the brothers of Banu Sa\u2018d ibn Bakr","translations":["ar","en","my","sv","cs","gu","yo","nl","ur","es","id","ug","bn","bs","si","hi","vi","ha","ml","te","sw","ps","as","sq","prs","el","bg","ff","kn","ky","lt","ro","rw","sr","tg","uz","ne","mos","ku","wo","so","fr","az","tl","uk","ta","bm","de","ka","pt","mk","hu","ru","zh","fa","km","mg","om","th","mr","pa","tr","ln","it","am","da","rn","kmr","ja","ms"]},{"id":"65061","title":"The Jews incurred Allah's wrath, and the Christians went astray","translations":["ar","en","my","sv","cs","gu","yo","ur","id","ug","si","hi","ha","sw","ps","as","prs","ky","or","vi","ne","rw","te","bs","lt","ro","ml","nl","so","sr","ku","uk","de","kn","wo","mos","sq","pt","ka","az","zh","hu","fa","mk","ta","ru","bn","am","mg","om","tl","th","mr","pa","tr","uz","km","es","kmr","tg"]},{"id":"65069","title":"Say 'there is no god but Allah', and I will testify for you by it on the Day of Judgment","translations":["ar","en","my","sv","cs","gu","yo","nl","ur","es","id","ug","bn","bs","si","hi","vi","ha","ml","te","sw","ps","as","sq","prs","el","bg","ff","kn","ky","lt","ro","rw","sr","tg","uz","ne","ku","wo","mos","so","fr","uk","tl","az","ta","bm","de","ka","pt","mk","hu","ru","zh","fa","km","am","mg","om","th","mr","pa","tr","ln","it","da","kmr","rn","ja","ms"]},{"id":"65071","title":"What you say and invite people to is indeed good. If only you could tell us whether there is an expiation for what we did","translations":["ar","en","my","sv","cs","gu","yo","nl","ur","id","ug","bn","si","hi","vi","ha","te","sw","ps","as","prs","ky","lt","rw","ne","ml","bs","kn","ku","ro","sq","so","sr","wo","mos","uk","tl","ta","az","fa","ka","zh","hu","pt","de","mk","ru","bm","am","mg","om","km","th","mr","pa","tr","it","uz","fr","es","kmr","ja","tg"]},{"id":"65426","title":"Whoever performs our prayer, faces our Qiblah (direction of the Ka\u2018bah), and eats from our slaughtered animals\u2014that is the Muslim who enjoys the protection (covenant) of Allah and His Messenger. So do not betray Allah by violating His protection","translations":["ar","pt","prs","mk","hu","vi","ka","bn","ku","th","as","id","nl","pa","sw","ha","km","en","gu","tl","ru","mr","ml","kn","sr","si","tr","hi","te","ur","bs"]},{"id":"66271","title":"Any person who says to his brother: O disbeliever, it will, indeed, fall upon one of them; if he is as he said, or else it will return to him","translations":["ar","vi","as","id","nl","sw","en","ha","gu","si","hu","ka","ro","ru","pt","th","bs","te","mr","prs","tr","am","bn","ku","mg","mk","uk","tl","km","pa","ps","sv","wo","mos","ml","hi","kn","ta","zh","sr","my","sq","fa"]}],"meta":{"current_page":"1","last_page":1,"total_items":23,"per_page":"300"}}